===Etymology===
From earlier *''xabris'', borrowed from a {{Ger.|fi}} language, compare {{term|hafr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈkɑuris]|lang=fi}}
* {{hyphenation|kau|ris}}

===Noun===
{{infl|fi|noun}}

# A mountain [[goat]], more specifically called ''[[alppikauris]]''.
# One born under the sign of [[Capricorn]].
# Any small [[deer]] of unspecified species, especially a [[roe deer]].

